Bourgui> this error line
Bourgui> "** No Device Record found, using defaults **".


Bourgui> Is someone can tell me what is wrong or missing in these infos.

Did you compile the DDR entry (on each cluster node) using the
"ddr_config -c" command?

The ddr_config display command you used is for parallel SCSI. If you
want to look at the Fibre Channel entry, then the correct command
becomes:

ddr_config -s disk HITACHI DF600F "" 2

